# Bring your mum, mums do drum!

_Happy Mothers day!.... why not do something different this year? Give your mum a treat to remember!_ _Are you busy this Sunday? and can't see your mum? Why not bring her to our special Mother's Day workshop._ _Special Mother's Day workshop._ _Monday May 13th  5-6pm_  _Drums provided, $20, mum comes for free!_ Maleny Neighbourhood Centre _Your mum will receive a chocolate and a 1hr class with you! Yay! and then perhaps dinner at The Upfront Club with LIVE Monday music? Sound like a good idea? Ph 0434585992 or email info@rhythmculture.com.au for bookings._
